  "officialHtml": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w500.html",
  "prefLabel": "He-W 512.03 Eligibility",
  "priorExpiration": "2016-06-29",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-W 512.03 Eligibility.\n\n(a) All newly eligible individuals shall receive services under the ABP, unless they are medically frail or identify as pregnant after application and opt to receive Medicaid state plan services.\n\n(b) Individuals who are eligible for medicaid through the New Hampshire Health Protection Program (NHHPP) shall be in the PAP unless the individual is exempt or voluntary as described in He-W 512.04(b) and (c) below.\n\nSource. #10656, eff 8-15-14; ss by #11012, INTERIM, eff 1-1-16, EXPIRES: 6-29-16; ss by #11119, eff 6-29-16",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-w500.html"
